/wiki/1.000.000\" title=\"1.000.000\">1.000.000</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2024-02-08\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/Game_Version?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/wiki/Game_Version?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:502px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Patch_Notes_Soft_Canon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/thumb/Patch_Notes_Soft_Canon.png/500px-Patch_Notes_Soft_Canon.png?18f536\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"81\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Patch_Notes_Soft_Canon.png/750px-Patch_Notes_Soft_Canon.png?18f536 1.5x, /images/thumb/Patch_Notes_Soft_Canon.png/1000px-Patch_Notes_Soft_Canon.png?18f536 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"174\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Patch_Notes_Soft_Canon.png\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>Baskinator commenting on patch notes being \"soft canon.\"</div></div></div>\n<ul><li>Occasionally, patch notes may contain humorous info relating to in-game lore. In a Discord comment by Baskinator, the Community Manager at Arrowhead, these bits of info can be considered \"soft canon lore,\" and is \"one of the very few places that the dev team can have a little bit of fun.\"</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261104023438\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [vary\u2010revision\u2010sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.263 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.518 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 